<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8" />
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
	<title>Doğanın Teknolojisi: Polinasyon & Yazılım</title>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#0d0d0d] text-[#e2e8f0] font-sans antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col selection:bg-white/20">

	<!-- 1. HEADER ALANI -->
